{"/about/":{"title":"About meditravelvn | meditravelvn","description":"Meet the meditravelvn travel design collection: one connected place to discover destinations, compare stays and plan a holiday. ","service":"about","mainAttrs":"id=\"main\"","main":"<div class=\"wrap\"><nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg><span aria-current=\"page\">About meditravelvn</span></nav></div><section class=\"wrap v3-about-hero\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">A WORLD OF GOOD TRIPS</span><h1>A little curiosity.<br>A whole lot of possibility.</h1><p>Travel starts long before the suitcase. It starts with a place that catches your eye, a conversation, an idea you keep coming back to.</p><p>meditravelvn brings those ideas together. Explore a destination, find a place to stay, build a holiday around the things you love, and plan the little journeys in between.</p><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/destinations/\">Find your next somewhere <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5\"/></svg></a></div><img src=\"/assets/hero-bali.webp\" alt=\"Bali island cliffs and turquoise water\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\"></section><section class=\"wrap v3-section\"><div class=\"grid-3\"><article class=\"card v3-about-card\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0ZM3 12h18M12 3c5 5 5 13 0 18-5-5-5-13 0-18Z\"/></svg><h2>Space to explore</h2><p>Country guides, city ideas and holiday collections give you a clear starting point.</p></article><article class=\"card v3-about-card\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0l-1 1-1-1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8L12 21l8.8-8.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8Z\"/></svg><h2>Room to make it yours</h2><p>Save the places you love and request an itinerary around your dates, people and preferences.</p></article><article class=\"card v3-about-card\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16v14H4V7ZM9 7V3h6v4M8 11v6m8-6v6\"/></svg><h2>The whole trip, together</h2><p>Countries, places, stays and holiday packages connect through dedicated pages and shared planning tools.</p></article></div><div class=\"sample-notice\">This is a travel portal design and planning prototype. Collections, hotel identities, pricing and availability are illustrative. A real travel provider must confirm bookings, final terms and pricing.</div></section>"},"/help/":{"title":"International Travel Planning Help | meditravelvn","description":"Explore international destinations, thoughtfully planned holidays, beautiful stays and private transfers with meditravelvn. ","service":"help","mainAttrs":"id=\"main\"","main":"<div class=\"wrap\"><nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg><span aria-current=\"page\">Help &amp; FAQs</span></nav></div><section class=\"wrap section\" style=\"padding-top:6px\"><div class=\"page-title\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">A LITTLE HELP ALONG THE WAY</span><h1>Good questions. Clear answers.</h1><p>Explore destinations, compare holiday ideas and send your travel preferences through the enquiry form.</p></div><div class=\"detail-layout\"><div><div class=\"detail-section\"><h2>Explore & plan</h2><details><summary>How do I find places within a country?</summary><p>Start with Destinations, choose a country, then explore its cities, areas and holiday packages. Country pages show packages for that country; place pages show packages that include that place.</p></details><details><summary>How do package filters work?</summary><p>Expand a country in the holiday sidebar and choose the whole country or one city or area. Combine this with budget, duration and travel style. Use Clear filters to broaden your results.</p></details><details><summary>Can I compare prices in my own currency?</summary><p>Use the currency selector in the header. Flight, package and stay prices, budget labels and enquiry summaries update together. Your choice is saved on this browser for your next visit.</p></details><details><summary>How does flight search work?</summary><p>Choose Flights, set your departure and arrival airports, dates, travellers and cabin class, then compare illustrative options. Round Trip adds a return date. The review page carries the flight preferences into a quote request; displayed schedules and fares are not live availability or ticket confirmations.</p></details><details><summary>Are these live exchange rates?</summary><p>No. Conversion uses configurable reference rates and is indicative. Your final quotation confirms the payable currency, actual rate if applicable, total price and inclusions.</p></details><details><summary>Can I view a hotel before choosing it?</summary><p>Yes. Stay pages show illustrative rooms, amenities and photographs. The displayed hotel names and rates are design concepts; confirmed accommodation would be stated in the final quotation.</p></details><details><summary>Where can I see the complete holiday itinerary?</summary><p>Every package has its own detail page with a proposed day-by-day plan, places covered, inclusions, exclusions and FAQs. Select Enquire About This Package to carry that package into the form.</p></details><details><summary>How do saved trips work?</summary><p>Tap the heart on a holiday package or stay. Your favourites are saved on this browser and appear on the Saved trips page. They are not reservations.</p></details></div><div class=\"detail-section\"><h2>Your enquiry</h2><details open><summary>What happens when I send the form?</summary><p>The portal validates and stores your enquiry, then displays a reference number. A success message appears only after the server confirms that the record was saved. Automatic email notifications are not connected in this version.</p></details><details><summary>Does an enquiry confirm a booking?</summary><p>No. The displayed packages and prices are travel concepts. Availability, accommodation, activities, payment schedules and booking or cancellation terms must be confirmed in a final quote before you make a commitment.</p></details><details><summary>What if sending fails?</summary><p>Your entries remain in the form so you can retry. If a retry follows an interrupted successful submission, the same request returns its existing reference rather than creating a duplicate.</p></details></div></div><aside class=\"summary-card sp-help-card\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0ZM3 12h18M12 3c5 5 5 13 0 18-5-5-5-13 0-18Z\"/></svg><h2>Ready for somewhere new?</h2><p>Start with a country, an experience or your favourite kind of holiday.</p><a href=\"/destinations/\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Explore countries <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5\"/></svg></a><a href=\"/plan-trip/\" class=\"btn btn-outline\">Send an enquiry</a></aside></div></section>"},"/photo-credits/":{"title":"Photography credits | meditravelvn","description":"Explore international destinations, thoughtfully planned holidays, beautiful stays and private transfers with meditravelvn. ","service":"help","mainAttrs":"id=\"main\"","main":"<div class=\"wrap\"><nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg><span aria-current=\"page\">Photography credits</span></nav></div><section class=\"wrap section\" style=\"padding-top:5px\"><div class=\"page-title\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">BEHIND THE BEAUTIFUL PLACES</span><h1>A world worth photographing.</h1><p>Real travel photography by talented creators. All images illustrate destinations or travel styles; they do not imply a commercial relationship with a property or vehicle provider.</p></div><div class=\"sp-credits\"><article class=\"card\"><img src=\"/assets/hero-bali.webp\" alt=\"Kelingking Beach, Nusa Penida, Bali, Indonesia\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h2>Polina Kuzovkova</h2><p>Kelingking Beach, Nusa Penida, Bali, Indonesia</p><a class=\"btn btn-link\" href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/black-rock-formation-on-sea-shore-during-daytime-WTW4XDkERK4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View original photograph <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12\"/></svg></a><a class=\"sp-license\" href=\"https://unsplash.com/license\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Unsplash License</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><img src=\"/assets/bali.webp\" alt=\"Bali, Indonesia\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h2>Aron Visuals</h2><p>Bali, Indonesia</p><a class=\"btn btn-link\" href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/temple-reflecting-in-bali-lake-1kdIG_258bU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View original photograph <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12\"/></svg></a><a class=\"sp-license\" href=\"https://unsplash.com/license\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Unsplash License</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><img src=\"/assets/dubai.webp\" alt=\"Dubai, United Arab Emirates\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h2>Ahmed Aldaie</h2><p>Dubai, United Arab Emirates</p><a class=\"btn btn-link\" href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/burj-khalifa-skyline-in-dubai-j-nRfGUHswQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View original photograph <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12\"/></svg></a><a class=\"sp-license\" href=\"https://unsplash.com/license\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Unsplash License</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><img src=\"/assets/maldi