r noreferrer\">Unsplash License</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><img src=\"/assets/usa.webp\" alt=\"New York, NY, United States of America\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h2>Yilei (Jerry) Bao</h2><p>New York, NY, United States of America</p><a class=\"btn btn-link\" href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/new-york-city-skyline-at-sunset-with-empire-state-building-Zmod14qJWws\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View original photograph <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12\"/></svg></a><a class=\"sp-license\" href=\"https://unsplash.com/license\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Unsplash License</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><img src=\"/assets/uae.webp\" alt=\"Dubai, United Arab Emirates\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h2>Leon Macapagal</h2><p>Dubai, United Arab Emirates</p><a class=\"btn btn-link\" href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/a-city-skyline-at-sunset-1kZF9ltbRjo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View original photograph <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12\"/></svg></a><a class=\"sp-license\" href=\"https://unsplash.com/license\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Unsplash License</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><img src=\"/assets/edinburgh.webp\" alt=\"Edinburgh, Scotland, United Kingdom\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h2>Intrepid</h2><p>Edinburgh, Scotland, United Kingdom</p><a class=\"btn btn-link\" href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/edinburgh-castle-overlooks-historic-city-street-with-autumn-foliage-mOppY7sWruc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View original photograph <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12\"/></svg></a><a class=\"sp-license\" href=\"https://unsplash.com/license\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Unsplash License</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><img src=\"/assets/langkawi.webp\"